meta {
  name: Retrieves catalog use cases
  type: http
  seq: 54
}

get {
  url: {{host-bff}}/catalog/use-cases
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: {{JWT}}
  Accept-Language: it-IT
}

docs {
  Retrieves the use cases of the catalog from the file use-cases/{lang}/data.json, where lang comes from the Accept-Language header (it or en). If the file cannot be read, the italian file is used; if the italian file cannot be read either, an empty array is returned.

  The EServices of each use case are split between subscribedEservices (an agreement of the requester PENDING, ACTIVE or SUSPENDED) and unsubscribedEservices. The EServices that are not found are ignored.
}
